What is the output of the following Java program traversing a multi-tiered exception chain?
```java
public class MultiTierChainApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            try {
                try {
                    throw new NumberFormatException("NaN");
                } catch (Exception e1) {
                    throw new IllegalArgumentException("Bad config", e1);
                }
            } catch (Exception e2) {
                throw new RuntimeException("Service crash", e2);
            }
        } catch (Exception e3) {
            Throwable root = e3.getCause().getCause();
            System.out.println(root.getMessage() + ":" + (root.getCause() == null));
        }
    }
}
```

